<title>UK: Manchester United names Gill finance head.</title>
<headline>Manchester United names Gill finance head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>English soccer club Manchester United Plc said on Monday it has named David Gill as its group finance director.</p>
<p>Gill, former finance director of First Choice Holidays Plc, will start at Manchester in February.</p>
<p>The company also said it promoted David Beswitherick to company secretary from group financial controller.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
